hoitus on tarkoitus toteuttaa HUSin vuoden 2026 investointiohjelmasta. Laite pitää olla toimitettu ja asennettu investointivuoden aikana 2026.\", \"descriptionSv\": \"\", \"procedureType\": \"\", \"estimatedValue\": null, \"expirationDate\": \"2027-03-07T05:49:44.708Z\", \"circularEconomy\": null, \"endUserInvolved\": null, \"descriptionOther\": \"\", \"solutionNewToBuyer\": null, \"employmentCondition\": null, \"procurementTypeCode\": \"supplies\", \"receivedTenderCount\": null, \"winnerOrganisations\": \"\", \"innovationConsidered\": null, \"lotResultTotalAmount\": null, \"justWorkingConditions\": null, \"listedGreenCriteriaUsed\": null, \"receivedApplicationCount\": null, \"tendersFromOtherEEACount\": null, \"sustainableFoodProduction\": null, \"energyEfficiencyConsidered\": null, \"includesFrameworkAgreement\": false, \"smeParticipationConsidered\": null, \"tendersFromOutsideEEACount\": null, \"lotResultTotalAmountCurrency\": null, \"solutionNewToMarketOrIndustry\": null, \"tendersFromMicroTenderersCount\": null, \"tendersFromSmallTenderersCount\": null, \"howManyOpportunitiesIsEstimated\": null, \"includesDynamicPurcharingSystem\": false, \"tendersFromMediumTenderersCount\": null, \"electronicallySubmittedTendersCount\": null, \"tendersVerifiedAndInadmissibleCount\": null, \"tendersNotVerifiedForAdmissibilityCount\": null, \"tendersFromMicroSmallMediumTenderersCount\": 2, \"tendersVerifiedAndInadmissibleLowValueCount\": null}], \"type\": \"E4\", \"isPlan\": false, \"planId\": 0, \"titleEn\": \"\", \"titleFi\": \"Höyryautoklaavi elatusaineiden sekä liuosten ja nesteputkien sterilointiin\", \"titleSv\": \"\", \"cpvCodes\": \"33191110 33191000\", \"currency\": null, \"deadline\": null, \"eFormsId\": \"35993988-db74-486e-a1c2-07fc0db39b9d\", \"isEForms\": true, \"mainType\": \"ContractAwardNotices\", \"noticeId\": 56419, \"lowCarbon\": null, \"nutsCodes\": \"FI\", \"titleOther\": \"\", \"isCancelled\": false, \"procedureId\": 32400, \"biodiversity\": null, \"dateMo